S. Voigt, J. Orphal, and J. P. Burrows
University of Bremen - Institute of Environmental Physics
P. O. Box 33 04 40
D-28334 Bremen, Germany
Tel. + 49 (0)421 218 3526	
e-mail: Susanne.Voigt@iup.physik.uni-bremen.de

Date:			October 1997
1. column title:	wavelength (vacuum)
1. column unit:		nm
2. column title:	wavenumber (vacuum)
2. column unit:		cm-1
3. column title:	absorption cross-section 
3. column unit:		cm2/molec
4. column title:	error absorption cross-section 
4. column unit:		cm2/molec

Wavelength range:	250 - 800 nm
Spectral Resolution:	0.5 cm-1 (12500-23000 cm-1 range)
			1 cm-1 (23000-40000 cm-1 range)
Number of data points in file:	122309

EXPERIMENTAL
Cell:	Multiple reflection quartz cell (White optics)
	optical pathlength 505 cm
Spectrometer:	BRUKER IFS 120HR Fourier-Transform-Spectrometer

